Yes. We work with SaaS, AI, ecommerce, technology, and service-based startups looking to
          improve organic visibility and build sustainable customer acquisition. The framework is the same across them;
          what changes is which commercial pages carry the revenue and how competitive the category already is.

We read the search-terms report and add negatives
        against it, which cuts the irrelevant traffic and protects the budget. The exclusion list is never finished;
        new versions of the same searches turn up every month.
